                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @errata
                        text "sql.ddl v0 carried three inaccuracies since adoption: (1) it claimed universal quote-doubling, but only identifiers on the Iden::prepare path double embedded quotes — index/constraint names are written raw between quotes; (2) it claimed all four wrapper enums dispatch to the builders, but only TableStatement has build/build_any/to_string methods; (3) its \"current limitation\" paragraph described src/database/statement.rs, deleted by decide.statement. Found by verify.sql; rule corrected at +1 with operator approval, all refs re-pinned."
                        after_done true
                    }

                    {
                        at 2026-09-02T14:41:26.167995Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @note
                        text "Stale epoch closed: sql.ddl bumped to +2 by decide.schema-comments (Comment joined the entry-point list) and create-table/column-def bumped +1 in the same commit; every impl and test reference was re-pinned in that branch and verified against the new text there (spec_stale clean, 893 tests green). No drift in this node's own implementation — the contract grew, and the growth shipped covered."
                        after_done true
