                        kind @decision
                        text "The audit's suggested is_owner+rel_type collapse is REJECTED on the implementing agent's analysis, accepted by the lead: all four combinations are reachable and meaningful (rel_type is cardinality, is_owner is FK direction; rev() legitimately yields HasMany with is_owner=false by negating one axis). Collapsing would rename a genuine product type without closing an illegal state. The deferred consequence in [dec:pgorm:invalid-states-unrepresentable] does not apply here."
                    }
                )
