                        at 2026-09-04T15:00:11.582801Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @note
                        text "Operator directive (2026-09-04): tackle the sheer verbosity of the ORM — the pipeline got its own node (ergo.fluent-pipeline); this one audits everything else. Survey the public surface for ceremony that outweighs information: the select_only().column_as(..).into_tuple::<T>() chains for projections, turbofish density, ActiveModel construction noise vs the From sugar, filter expression spelling (ColumnTrait's eq taking Into<Value> vs the pipeline's shapes), Selector/SelectorRaw entry ergonomics, transaction closure signatures, anything where a common task takes 3+ chained calls of boilerplate. Deliverable: a ranked report — each finding with today's spelling, a proposed spelling, breakage class, and effort — for the operator to pick a batch from. No code changes; probes allowed to prove a proposed spelling typechecks."
