            {
                id python.design
                title "Record Python API architecture, contracts and dependency breakdown"
                kind @docs
                sealed true
                log (
                    {
                        at 2026-09-08T15:32:14.568106Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @note
                        text "Operator requested AKM, WBS and specifications for an optional public PyO3 API and generated pgorm testing. Added docs/spec/python.md, plan/decisions/python-api.md and scoped architecture elements. The public package supports application schemas, concrete entity registrations, asyncio, exact conversion, lifecycle, typing and reviewable distribution artifacts. Implementation is future work; the planning request does not publish a package."
